I would certainly use Fire Brand.  I'm addicted to using Frost Brand (I
have a nasty tendency to spend as many turns sacrificing as it takes to
get it, no matter what), but seriously speaking, unless you're against
fire resistant stuff it's the most powerful in the game.  Admittedly
there's more fire resistant stuff than cold resistant, but that just
makes it second best.

One other point is that of the weapons you've listed, Fire Brand is the
only one that gets double damage against most monsters.  That means
that enchanting it counts double when it comes to damage calculations,
making it even more the logical choice.  I would keep Excalibur and
Sunsword in a bag if I could (or forget the bag if you want the demon
princes to hate you), just for their specific uses (searching and
light, of course), but besides that you shouldn't be using them when
you have something as awesome as one of the FB's.

Keep a katana wielded second, it does the most damage.  Your silver
saber will do fine until you get one.

